{
  "about": "The Asset library's list of world pieces (bible #assets). kit-source.mjs finds every export in `files`; this file only says how to group and show them, and what the audit (notes/architecture/world-kit.md, section 2) found built twice. A new export in a listed file shows up on its own. Paths are relative to game3d/js. Variant args: $p a Parts collector, $sets blockSets(), $face the south face of a 4 x 2 block, $set a lightSet(), $root the preview group, $kit a dorms Kit; collectors are built after the call. `then` calls methods on what the builder returns.",
